5uad|n|A person of either sex who has not attained the age at which full civil rights are accorded; an infant; in England and the United States, one under twenty-one years of age. ; The minor term, that is, the subject of the conclusion; also, the minor premise, that is, that premise which contains the minor term; in hypothetical syllogisms, the categorical premise. It is the second proposition of a regular syllogism, as in the following: Every act of injustice partakes of meanness; to take money from another by gaming is an act of injustice; therefore, the taking of money from another by gaming partakes of meanness. ; A Minorite; a Franciscan friar.	a:5ysi,81,3;5phc,77,341;43rt,73,2;acwz,72,5;a9gj,66,1;a03g,61,6;3z6d,58,859;70gj,55,29;a66g,54,5;kje,53,112;6ai,50,11;5i9m,50,2040;81pw,49,1;6zpn,48,1;2loe,48,25~5i9m,50,2040;3z6d,58,859;67aj,28,665;7vmg,23,487;5phc,77,341;kje,53,112;3c6p,14,103;9qsu,17,92;7ehw,16,61;70gj,55,29;3ehe,14,29;2loe,48,25;9qbe,33,20;5urg,38,19;1i1g,24,17	v:5ehp,95,6;2u4x,70,8;a66g,59,7;3rfa,44,2;196k,43,3;7cm0,28,196;kje,25,16;5phc,23,8;70gj,22,3;72b9,14,1;6egd,11,1;2g9j,9,4;jns,6,1~7cm0,28,196;kje,25,16;2u4x,70,8;5phc,23,8;a66g,59,7;5ehp,95,6;2g9j,9,4;196k,43,3;70gj,22,3;3rfa,44,2;72b9,14,1;6egd,11,1;jns,6,1	V:aelz,98,6;8lc3,58,4;1v1q,49,2;5wuz,47,2;7ytm,44,2;6c0i,43,1;2g9j,39,31;6cjo,32,10;7nhs,25,1;951i,25,2;1ji3,24,3;818e,23,4;100v,18,7;9xyf,17,6;40r9,16,15~2g9j,39,31;8x6r,11,29;alzt,2,17;40r9,16,15;6cjo,32,10;k6w,1,8;100v,18,7;9xyf,17,6;aelz,98,6;8lc3,58,4;818e,23,4;nar,1,4;1ji3,24,3;70gj,16,2;5wuz,47,2	n:a66g,92,67;5ehp,85,3;42mc,70,2;1rw6,69,98;196k,67,16;kje,67,280;9zpz,66,1;acwz,65,3;7vgg,65,1;a0d9,63,1;6kbd,60,3;81pw,59,2;4365,59,3;6zpn,58,2;6znq,57,7~kje,67,280;1rw6,69,98;a66g,92,67;tb6,20,52;3z6d,17,48;5phc,47,42;2qkw,36,39;7ehw,5,29;8lbp,4,17;196k,67,16;3ehe,1,12;4s49,21,11;5ywm,38,10;6m46,17,8;1igz,39,8	N:7ov4,139,1817;2t7x,79,70;16rz,73,17;72zf,72,1;70gj,67,68;8gdr,62,4;7nhq,60,7;6cjp,60,11;70dq,58,6;6d7c,55,5;6cjj,55,88;6c0f,5